WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:02.234
This example creates a Sale class that

00:00:02.261 --> 00:00:05.566
combines stored data with a calculation The

00:00:05.592 --> 00:00:07.711
dunder init method receives an item a

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:10.947
price and a quantity These values are

00:00:10.974 --> 00:00:13.053
stored as self dot item self dot

00:00:13.066 --> 00:00:16.421
price and self dot quantity The class

00:00:16.447 --> 00:00:19.434
also defines a method named total The

00:00:19.447 --> 00:00:22.066
total method returns self dot price multiplied

00:00:22.092 --> 00:00:25.408
by self dot quantity Notice that total

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.158
does not need the price and quantity

00:00:27.171 --> 00:00:30.066
to be passed again Those values are

00:00:30.092 --> 00:00:33.711
already stored inside the object Next we

00:00:33.737 --> 00:00:36.829
create one Sale object The item is

00:00:36.855 --> 00:00:39.000
Notebook the price is twelve dollars and

00:00:39.026 --> 00:00:41.342
fifty cents and the quantity is four

00:00:42.276 --> 00:00:44.316
The print statements display the item name

00:00:44.487 --> 00:00:46.447
the quantity and the result of calling

00:00:46.474 --> 00:00:49.724
sale dot total Before running the cell

00:00:49.961 --> 00:00:53.618
calculate the total yourself Twelve dollars and

00:00:53.645 --> 00:00:56.184
fifty cents multiplied by four equals fifty

00:00:56.211 --> 00:01:00.368
dollars Click Run now The terminal should

00:01:00.382 --> 00:01:02.171
show Notebook as the item four as

00:01:02.197 --> 00:01:04.039
the quantity and a total of fifty

00:01:04.053 --> 00:01:07.579
dollars formatted with two decimal places Now

00:01:07.605 --> 00:01:09.605
change the quantity from four to six

00:01:09.632 --> 00:01:12.303
and run the cell again The total

00:01:12.329 --> 00:01:14.908
should change automatically because the method uses

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:18.171
the object's current price and quantity You

00:01:18.197 --> 00:01:20.197
can also change the price and observe

00:01:20.224 --> 00:01:23.079
the result The main idea is that

00:01:23.092 --> 00:01:26.526
related data and behavior stay together The

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:28.434
Sale object stores the details of the

00:01:28.447 --> 00:01:30.618
sale and its total method performs a

00:01:30.645 --> 00:01:33.316
calculation that belongs naturally to that sale
